    <string name="sr_title">Super-resolution</string>
    <string name="sr_settings">Super-resolution settings and models</string>
    <string name="sr_description">waifu2x enlarges still images at the selected scale; 4× and 8× use repeated 2× enhancement. Speed mode is the default; quality mode preserves grayscale more closely. Tap the reader SR button to enable, or hold it to process the whole gallery, retry a page, or compare images. When both features need a page, translation finishes first, then super-resolution, before the next page starts. Each feature keeps its own preprocessing range and reads the original. Results are saved in tiles; interrupted work resumes from saved tiles. Animations and images that cannot fit the working memory budget are skipped.</string>
